AUDIO: 'Hi, I\'m Yahya. I just got into Y Combinator and I\'m building context.dev. Context turns the internet into an API purpose-built for agents. You can crawl entire websites to clean markdown for AI in seconds. Turn a domain into enriched company profiles or set up monitors'

[00:13] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'across the web to be notified when things change. Today, teams build this infrastructure on different stacks and get stuck maintaining it. Browsers, proxies, crawlers, parsers, retries, and extraction. And that\'s just to get the'

[00:26] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'data. Then scheduling, storage, and change detection to keep it up to date. Context gives you one platform for all of your web infrastructure. Give us a URL and get clean markdown, rendered HTML, images, or structured JSON. Now agents can ask what\'s true, what'

[00:39] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'changed, and what needs action without having to recrawl the entire website. Thank you to over 400 customers who use this as infrastructure for web context, enrichment, and hundreds of other use cases. context.dev is live. Give your agents'

